#, xml-text
msgid ""
"is a tool that can build plug-ins or scripts and install them if they are "
"distributed in one source file.  <command>gimptool-2.99</command> can also "
"be used by programs that need to know what libraries and include-paths The "
"<application>Gimp</application> was compiled with"
